(text "Self-powered from DC input. USB VBUS is sense-only (PA9); never join it to VIN or 3V3.\nFirmware: attach USB only when VBUS is present; PA0..PA3 = TIM2 CH1..CH4, inverted duty.\nPB6/PB7 = I2C1 SCL/SDA. PA13/PA14 = SWD. Keep default boot option bytes for flash boot." (at 25.4000 172.7200 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3d04897c-e573-516c-8b5a-fa895f2c4a9b"))
